{"id":"n29043-1-7","stage":3,"title":"서투르다 · 生疏","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29043-1-7-1","ko":"그 가수는 비록 춤에는 서투르지만 노래는 정말 잘해요.","zh":"虽然那位歌手跳舞不太擅长，但唱歌真的非常好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"1","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"가수는","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가수는","audio":"/audio/9b3d7a366b46b683a5a1.mp3"}},{"text":"비록","meaning":"虽然，尽管","explanation":"비록：虽然，尽管。","readings":[{"term":"비록","audio":"/audio/cb538ee4d1f6c8e6244c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60894","senseId":"1","lemma":"비록","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비록","audio":"/audio/cb538ee4d1f6c8e6244c.mp3"}},{"text":"춤에는","meaning":"舞蹈","explanation":"춤：舞蹈；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"춤","audio":"/audio/0a72ac28b3e9721b7e27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29542","senseId":"1","lemma":"춤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"춤에는","audio":"/audio/51183ae5fd6f1fce3b40.mp3"}},{"text":"서투르지만","meaning":"生疏，笨拙","explanation":"서투르다：生疏，笨拙；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"서투르다","audio":"/audio/99f15241a42214b2a477.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29043","senseId":"1","lemma":"서투르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서투르지만","audio":"/audio/a5e17aee5dc082b23f53.mp3"}},{"text":"노래는","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래는","audio":"/audio/06846fc90a74d02c0801.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"잘해요.","meaning":"棒","explanation":"잘하다：棒；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잘하다","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70073","senseId":"2","lemma":"잘하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘해요","audio":"/audio/6a486a25f866f6d67f10.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代与听话人较近或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"cb538ee4d1f6c8e6","term":"비록","zh":"虽然，尽管","audio":"/audio/cb538ee4d1f6c8e6244c.mp3","entryId":"60894","definition":"即便是那样。","pronunciation":["비록"]},{"id":"0a72ac28b3e9721b","term":"춤","zh":"舞蹈","audio":"/audio/0a72ac28b3e9721b7e27.mp3","entryId":"29542","definition":"随着音乐或节奏舞动身体。","pronunciation":["춤"]},{"id":"99f15241a42214b2","term":"서투르다","zh":"生疏，笨拙","audio":"/audio/99f15241a42214b2a477.mp3","entryId":"29043","definition":"对某事不熟练或不擅长。","pronunciation":["서ː투르다"]},{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"039fa50765b5cd6f","term":"잘하다","zh":"棒","audio":"/audio/039fa50765b5cd6feb79.mp3","entryId":"70073","definition":"做得好、优秀。","pronunciation":["잘하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7b818dd277ea8253ebe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29043-1-7-2","ko":"노래를 한번 들어보고 싶네요.","zh":"我想听他唱一首歌看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노래를","meaning":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","explanation":"노래：歌，歌曲，唱歌；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"노래","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20195","senseId":"1","lemma":"노래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노래를","audio":"/audio/e4d8b71da5f5c71ee421.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"들어보고","meaning":"听；试，试图","explanation":"듣다：听；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어보고","audio":"/audio/84088a8a0cd49c07a62e.mp3"}},{"text":"싶네요.","meaning":"要，想","explanation":"싶다：要，想；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62657","senseId":"1","lemma":"싶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶네요","audio":"/audio/8c49fcc950416d364e3c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"edcad1c9c3dba9e9","term":"노래","zh":"歌，歌曲，唱歌","audio":"/audio/edcad1c9c3dba9e99435.mp3","entryId":"20195","definition":"给具有韵律的歌词添加曲子的音乐；或放声唱出那样的音乐。","pronunciation":["노래"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"i